WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:01:42.069 --> 00:01:45.672
<i>Passing tower 8.
You copy?</i>


00:02:06.093 --> 00:02:09.264
<i>Look at that. It's...
it's like an empty vegetable.</i>


00:02:09.297 --> 00:02:10.831
<i>It grows in the forest.</i>


00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:17.105
<i>I don't know maybe,</i>


00:02:17.139 --> 00:02:20.241
<i>maybe... maybe I should just...</i>


00:02:20.274 --> 00:02:22.709
<i>give it a go,
set up my own shop.</i>


00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.745
<i>Yeah.
Take your own team.</i>


00:02:26.281 --> 00:02:28.150
<i>Yeah. I would need
my whole team</i>


00:02:28.183 --> 00:02:30.152
<i>but that would
gut the whole department.</i>


00:02:30.185 --> 00:02:31.619
<i>What do you think,
they'd come?</i>


00:02:41.164 --> 00:02:43.365
<i>Welcome to engineering.</i>


00:02:43.398 --> 00:02:46.101
<i>Please beware
of your surroundings.</i>


00:02:59.982 --> 00:03:01.317
<i>Come in.</i>


00:03:02.884 --> 00:03:05.221
Coming up on your 40.
Can you see me?


00:03:37.186 --> 00:03:40.256
<i>Welcome back
employee George Almore.</i>


00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.725
Have a safe and productive day.


00:03:46.896 --> 00:03:48.365
Did you pick me up on anything?


00:03:48.398 --> 00:03:50.800
Area 19 through 22,


00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:54.071
and the infrared grid
was showing some heat in places.


00:03:54.104 --> 00:03:55.339
Okay.


00:03:55.372 --> 00:03:59.008
All right let's get this power
rerouted. I got stuff running.


00:03:59.041 --> 00:04:00.042
All right, on my count.


00:04:00.843 --> 00:04:04.114
Three, two, one, now.


00:04:05.482 --> 00:04:07.884
<i>Power rerouted.</i>


00:04:07.918 --> 00:04:11.188
You now, if anyone asks you to
reactivate a mothball facility


00:04:11.221 --> 00:04:13.924
by yourself, you say no.


00:04:13.957 --> 00:04:15.858
You say no and then
you go get a burger.


00:04:16.893 --> 00:04:18.263
Come on.


00:04:20.131 --> 00:04:21.797
I'd like to try a burger.


00:04:28.105 --> 00:04:30.107
All right.


00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:33.076
Today's review is gonna be
same as always, just...


00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.446
stay out of sight while we have
a conference call, okay?


00:04:41.486 --> 00:04:43.321
Morning.


00:04:46.756 --> 00:04:48.791
Want the TV?


00:05:00.939 --> 00:05:02.974
I had that dream
again last night.


00:05:03.007 --> 00:05:05.410
Yeah?


00:05:05.443 --> 00:05:07.980
Is it the same as last time?


00:05:08.013 --> 00:05:10.181
We were in a car driving.


00:05:14.152 --> 00:05:16.487
We were in car?


00:05:16.521 --> 00:05:18.489
Where were we going?


00:05:18.523 --> 00:05:19.756
I don't know.


00:05:20.791 --> 00:05:21.926
Just driving.


00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.797
Okay, well...
Was it nice driving or...


00:05:26.532 --> 00:05:27.732
or not nice driving.


00:05:29.301 --> 00:05:30.369
Just driving.


00:05:33.938 --> 00:05:36.507
Was there anything else you might remember?
Anything at all?


00:05:39.178 --> 00:05:41.247
No.


00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:44.882
Just sitting in the car
watching the things go past.


00:05:44.917 --> 00:05:47.052
It was pretty,
but when I woke up,


00:05:47.086 --> 00:05:49.288
- I felt sad.
- Yeah, well...


00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.824
dreams can do that, you know.


00:06:11.344 --> 00:06:13.280
She wants to talk to you.


00:06:14.547 --> 00:06:16.549
George.


00:06:16.583 --> 00:06:18.385
- She wants to talk to you.
- I know, I know.


00:06:18.418 --> 00:06:20.453
I know she does, it's okay.
Thank you though.


00:06:25.324 --> 00:06:27.393
Okay, can you get her
ready for the evaluation?


00:06:29.229 --> 00:06:30.463
Thanks.


00:07:14.941 --> 00:07:15.942
<i>Hello?</i>


00:07:17.278 --> 00:07:19.447
Hey. I'm here.


00:07:20.181 --> 00:07:21.282
<i>Hey.</i>


00:07:23.417 --> 00:07:24.418
<i>How's my man?</i>


00:07:25.386 --> 00:07:27.221
You know, missing you, a bit...


00:07:28.289 --> 00:07:29.290
a lot.


00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:30.991
Same as usual.


00:07:32.426 --> 00:07:33.495
<i>Missing you too.</i>


00:07:37.665 --> 00:07:39.333
<i>So, not going out?</i>


00:07:41.102 --> 00:07:42.269
<i>All work no play, huh?</i>


00:07:45.239 --> 00:07:46.407
You know me.


00:07:48.976 --> 00:07:50.412
<i>Yeah. I do know you.</i>


00:07:50.445 --> 00:07:51.480
Hey, hey, Jules?


00:07:52.614 --> 00:07:54.082
Jules can you hear me?


00:07:54.116 --> 00:07:56.585
<i>- Hello?
- I'm here.</i>


00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:05.292
<i>I really hope
you're happy there.</i>


00:08:06.728 --> 00:08:08.029
You know, it's beautiful here.


00:08:14.436 --> 00:08:16.037
<i>I've always...</i>


00:08:17.506 --> 00:08:18.607
Hey, don't...


00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.109
- I just can't do this anymore.
- Don't say that.


00:08:21.143 --> 00:08:22.945
<i>Talk like this it,</i>


00:08:22.979 --> 00:08:24.613
<i>it's just too hard.</i>


00:08:24.646 --> 00:08:25.680
Jules, listen to me.


00:08:28.016 --> 00:08:29.418
<i>I'm sorry.</i>


00:08:34.189 --> 00:08:35.223
<i>Goodbye, George.</i>


00:08:38.161 --> 00:08:39.729
<i>- Hey, don't, don't...
- I love you.</i>


00:08:56.712 --> 00:09:00.116
<i>- Come on, tell me.
- What?</i>


00:09:00.149 --> 00:09:01.350
- Give them back.
- No.


00:09:01.384 --> 00:09:02.652
- No, come on.
- No.


00:09:02.685 --> 00:09:03.820
Give them back.


00:09:03.853 --> 00:09:07.056
No. No, babe I'm fine.
Once they're on, they are mine.


00:09:07.089 --> 00:09:09.058
Come on,
just put it in auto.


00:09:09.091 --> 00:09:11.028
I don't want to.
It's my car. It's our car.


00:09:11.061 --> 00:09:12.595
I'm gonna drive it, not a robot.


00:09:12.628 --> 00:09:15.498
But what's the point of having this
car if you're just going to drive it.


00:09:15.531 --> 00:09:20.169
Because it's being driven
by something I didn't design.


00:09:20.203 --> 00:09:23.005
Mmm. For someone who likes
robots so much...


00:09:24.373 --> 00:09:25.675
I like robots,


00:09:25.708 --> 00:09:27.578
just my own, you know.
That's why I build them.


00:09:48.332 --> 00:09:51.201
<i>George.
Are you hearing me?</i>


00:09:52.569 --> 00:09:53.737
Yeah, yeah. I'm hearing you.


00:09:55.105 --> 00:09:56.640
Where is everybody?


00:09:56.673 --> 00:09:58.575
<i>- I thought we were supposed to be doing a review.
- Cancelled.</i>


00:09:58.609 --> 00:10:01.512
<i>Very busy over here.
Big security review.</i>


00:10:01.545 --> 00:10:03.514
Just file what you're doing
and get it over.


00:10:03.547 --> 00:10:05.649
If I stop to file
everything I'm doing


00:10:05.682 --> 00:10:06.884
I'm never gonna get
any work done.


00:10:06.918 --> 00:10:09.219
<i>How are you doing getting those
security systems back up?</i>


00:10:10.187 --> 00:10:11.755
Well, no great.


00:10:11.788 --> 00:10:13.090
There's still lot to do.


00:10:13.123 --> 00:10:14.324
You really let this place
go to seed.


00:10:14.358 --> 00:10:15.592
<i>Oh, just get it done.</i>


00:10:15.626 --> 00:10:17.495
Is this really necessary?
I don't have time...


00:10:17.529 --> 00:10:19.197
<i>Very necessary.</i>


00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:21.266
<i>Things are getting hot
with Otaku.</i>


00:10:21.299 --> 00:10:23.468
<i>We got a few of them
in custody.</i>


00:10:23.501 --> 00:10:25.403
<i>Off the record of course.</i>


00:10:25.436 --> 00:10:28.572
Wow. So we're kidnapping people now.


00:10:28.605 --> 00:10:30.507
<i>It's the cost of
doing business.</i>


00:10:30.541 --> 00:10:32.610
<i>They'd do the same to us.</i>


00:10:32.644 --> 00:10:35.547
<i>We're assigning armed response
details to all our facilities</i>


00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.382
<i>Nobody even knows
where this place is.</i>


00:10:37.415 --> 00:10:39.284
<i>I don't need
an armed response unit.</i>


00:10:39.317 --> 00:10:41.386
<i>Don't worry, George.
I've got some good news.</i>


00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.655
<i>Hollins is out.</i>


00:10:43.688 --> 00:10:45.623
<i>Gone.</i>


00:10:45.657 --> 00:10:48.192
<i>I'm the new V.P.
of internal development.</i>


00:10:48.226 --> 00:10:51.863
<i>We are thinking of folding
everything into my program.</i>


00:10:51.896 --> 00:10:54.132
No, no, no.
I have a three-year contract.


00:10:54.165 --> 00:10:55.400
You can't just shut me down.


00:10:55.433 --> 00:10:58.169
<i>Two and a half and we haven't
really seen anything yet,</i>


00:10:58.202 --> 00:11:00.772
<i>except for that ugly thing.</i>


00:11:00.805 --> 00:11:03.074
<i>But it would be such a pity
if you couldn't deliver.</i>


00:11:04.542 --> 00:11:07.279
How's, uh... How's your
pet project going, Simone?


00:11:07.313 --> 00:11:10.649
<i>My pet project will define
the future of robotics</i>


00:11:10.683 --> 00:11:13.586
<i>for at least the next 20 years.</i>


00:11:13.619 --> 00:11:17.755
<i>Artisan robotics research isn't
really the future of this company.</i>


00:11:17.789 --> 00:11:20.625
<i>- Oh.
- Oh, come on, George.</i>


00:11:20.658 --> 00:11:23.829
<i>My prototype sailed through
the Halderman tests.</i>


00:11:23.862 --> 00:11:27.132
<i>I mean that thing doesn't even speak.</i>


00:11:28.334 --> 00:11:31.270
Congratulations, Simone.
That's great.


00:11:31.303 --> 00:11:33.472
Uh, is that it?
I'm trying to conserve energy.


00:11:33.505 --> 00:11:34.473
<i>Oh no,
we're not doing this again.</i>


00:11:34.506 --> 00:11:36.275
<i>There is no way
you're getting a new line.</i>


00:11:36.308 --> 00:11:37.409
<i>Out of the question.</i>


00:11:37.443 --> 00:11:38.877
I'm talking about my own energy.


00:11:38.911 --> 00:11:40.479
This is a waste of my time.


00:11:40.512 --> 00:11:43.515
<i>Get those security systems
back up.</i>


00:11:43.549 --> 00:11:44.883
<i>I want this place secure.</i>


00:11:48.287 --> 00:11:49.688
Yeah.


00:11:52.891 --> 00:11:55.829
<i>- Call terminated.
- I don't like her</i>


00:11:57.464 --> 00:11:58.465
She's a bitch.


00:11:59.599 --> 00:12:01.201
Yeah, you're right.


00:12:02.502 --> 00:12:04.803
She is a very smug lady


00:12:04.837 --> 00:12:08.641
and she loves herself very much.


00:12:08.674 --> 00:12:10.810
The less she knows
about you two the better.


00:12:10.844 --> 00:12:13.680
If she knew about you,
she would pull your brain out


00:12:13.713 --> 00:12:17.517
and take it apart
piece by piece.


00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:20.720
She'd realize what and idiot she'd
been for marginalizing my research.


00:12:22.489 --> 00:12:25.225
Because she wouldn't be able to
put you back together, would she?


00:12:35.468 --> 00:12:38.672
You're not ugly.


00:12:38.705 --> 00:12:39.906
<i>Take your own team.</i>


00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.910
<i>Yeah. I would need
my whole team,</i>


00:12:42.944 --> 00:12:44.980
<i>and that would gut
their whole department.</i>


00:12:45.013 --> 00:12:47.248
<i>What do you think,
they'd come?</i>


00:12:47.281 --> 00:12:49.985
<i>Well, I'm pretty sure I could
appeal to their sensibilities.</i>


00:12:50.018 --> 00:12:51.651
<i>I know
what they're getting paid.</i>


00:13:21.882 --> 00:13:24.251
<i>Oh, screw this
boundary line thing.</i>


00:13:26.922 --> 00:13:29.256
<i>Stop filming me.
Come on, come on.</i>


00:13:46.707 --> 00:13:48.310
<i>Come on. Stop.</i>


00:13:48.343 --> 00:13:49.745
<i>Come on. Let's go have a drink.</i>


00:14:19.407 --> 00:14:21.444
I swear this thing's
got ghosts in it.


00:14:30.418 --> 00:14:32.320
You okay?


00:14:32.354 --> 00:14:33.455
You're being very quiet.


00:14:36.025 --> 00:14:37.059
This about you dream?


00:14:39.462 --> 00:14:40.863
No.


00:14:40.897 --> 00:14:42.431
I know it's just a dream.


00:14:43.599 --> 00:14:44.700
Do you have the ten?


00:14:56.746 --> 00:14:57.780
You're welcome.


00:15:02.451 --> 00:15:07.057
Why haven't you asked me to help
you in your workshop lately?


00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.994
Is that it? Are you getting
bored out here with me?


00:15:10.028 --> 00:15:12.563
- I thought we were a team.
- Yeah, of course we are.


00:15:13.831 --> 00:15:16.466
I know what
you're doing in there.


00:15:18.868 --> 00:15:20.037
We talked about this, okay?


00:15:21.171 --> 00:15:22.505
I'm not replacing you.


00:15:24.407 --> 00:15:25.908
You made another like me...


00:15:25.943 --> 00:15:27.845
but better.


00:15:27.878 --> 00:15:29.646
- Different.
- Better.


00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.950
Just like I'm better
than my sister.


00:15:31.983 --> 00:15:34.585
Different, okay?


00:15:34.618 --> 00:15:37.521
Look, can you get back to
the house? You're getting wet.


00:15:37.554 --> 00:15:40.657
I need to check this module
see if she triggered the system.


00:16:41.053 --> 00:16:42.887
I know you can hear me.


00:16:42.922 --> 00:16:44.856
I put you into
a hibernation state, okay?


00:16:44.889 --> 00:16:46.658
Just... It's just like sleeping.


00:16:46.691 --> 00:16:49.495
You'll be fine,
and when you wake,


00:16:49.528 --> 00:16:51.730
I'm gonna be here
to take care of you.


00:16:53.565 --> 00:16:54.767
Everything's gonna be fine.


00:17:25.664 --> 00:17:29.069
<i>Subject J1 showing me where
she could win an egg and spoon race.</i>


00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.105
<i>I'm kidding...</i>


00:17:33.572 --> 00:17:34.941
Get you running in no time.


00:18:14.681 --> 00:18:16.750
<i>Why don't you
stop filming me?</i>


00:18:16.783 --> 00:18:18.986
<i>I'm documenting
your career trajectory</i>


00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.956
<i>and by the sounds of it we're
going to need this in court...</i>


00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:51.119
<i>Welcome
to vehicle storage.</i>


00:18:51.153 --> 00:18:53.554
<i>Have a safe and productive day.</i>


00:19:12.673 --> 00:19:14.009
It's okay.


00:19:16.645 --> 00:19:18.147
What're you doing in here, boy?


00:19:22.184 --> 00:19:25.087
Go, go. Come on. Go. Go, go.


00:19:29.024 --> 00:19:31.227
House, close the door.


00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:35.331
<i>- Unable to execute command.
- Close it.</i>


00:19:35.364 --> 00:19:37.866
<i>- Did you open the door?
- Security system error</i>


00:19:37.899 --> 00:19:40.336
<i>identified in vehicle storage.</i>


00:19:43.406 --> 00:19:45.974
Have you been into
the security systems?


00:19:46.007 --> 00:19:47.310
No.


00:19:49.011 --> 00:19:50.379
What's happening?


00:19:50.413 --> 00:19:52.315
Get the orange bag,
meet me outside.


00:20:03.259 --> 00:20:05.095
Thanks.


00:20:05.129 --> 00:20:07.297
Can you check the shutters?
I think the runners are jammed.


00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.974
Hey, I'm gonna need your help
again soon. Is that okay?


00:20:18.007 --> 00:20:19.175
What is it?


00:20:19.208 --> 00:20:20.776
Uh, I just wanna take
a look at your legs.


00:20:21.979 --> 00:20:22.980
Why?


00:20:23.813 --> 00:20:26.682
Um, check the wear.


00:20:26.716 --> 00:20:28.851
- They're fine.
- Yeah, I know they're fine.


00:20:29.819 --> 00:20:31.787
But I'm gonna have to build
another pair soon,


00:20:31.821 --> 00:20:33.390
and I want the diagnostics
driving the design.


00:20:33.423 --> 00:20:35.091
Do you understand?


00:20:46.336 --> 00:20:48.838
Do you know anything about this?


00:20:48.871 --> 00:20:51.275
Somebody's been in here and
changed components. What is this?


00:20:51.308 --> 00:20:53.978
- It wasn't me.
- Don't lie to me.


00:20:54.012 --> 00:20:57.148
We only have a few of these spare and
we need them for the security cameras.


00:20:59.183 --> 00:21:02.019
Look, what we're doing here,


00:21:02.052 --> 00:21:04.488
is very, very important,
all right?


00:21:04.521 --> 00:21:07.224
Limited resources.
Don't second guess me.


00:21:07.257 --> 00:21:11.095
- I didn't do anything.
- You didn't do anything. Yeah.


00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:24.874
<i>Vehicle approaching.</i>


00:21:36.554 --> 00:21:39.723
<i>Two vehicles are
requesting entry.</i>


00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:46.065
House, put 'em on speaker.


00:21:46.098 --> 00:21:48.066
<i>Mr. Almore.</i>


00:21:48.099 --> 00:21:49.968
<i>My name is Vincent Sinclair</i>


00:21:50.001 --> 00:21:53.271
<i>and this is my associate,
Mr. J.P. Melvin.</i>


00:21:54.339 --> 00:21:55.506
<i>We're here to see your wife.</i>


00:22:12.023 --> 00:22:13.458
Girls, listen up.


00:22:13.491 --> 00:22:15.893
Back in your base. All right,
back in your base. Come on.


00:22:15.928 --> 00:22:17.129
Come on,
there's some people here,


00:22:17.162 --> 00:22:20.165
and I need you to play dead
until they're gone, all right?


00:22:20.199 --> 00:22:22.568
You too. All right, come on.
Back up, back up.


00:22:22.601 --> 00:22:24.270
It is very, very important.


00:22:24.303 --> 00:22:25.971
Come on, there you go,
there you go.


00:22:26.005 --> 00:22:28.140
Very important you do not move
until I come and get you,


00:22:28.173 --> 00:22:29.341
do you understand?


00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:50.530
Thank you, Mr. Almore.


00:22:50.563 --> 00:22:56.002
We received the notifications of
your wife's transition to Somnolence.


00:22:56.036 --> 00:22:57.370
She's not ready to go yet.


00:22:58.571 --> 00:23:00.838
Of course.


00:23:00.872 --> 00:23:03.209
Do please excuse our machines.


00:23:03.243 --> 00:23:06.613
It's just standard
company procedure.


00:23:06.646 --> 00:23:10.050
We need to check the conditions are
optimal for your remaining usage.


00:23:11.084 --> 00:23:12.185
Mmm-hmm, sure.


00:23:12.218 --> 00:23:14.321
Mr. Melvin will run a few tests.


00:23:20.294 --> 00:23:22.363
Sir.


00:23:22.396 --> 00:23:25.365
Subject is Almore, Julie Alice.


00:23:25.398 --> 00:23:28.635
Term time so far two years,
eight months, four days.


00:23:28.668 --> 00:23:29.902
That's right.


00:23:29.936 --> 00:23:32.105
Any problems with the line?


00:23:32.672 --> 00:23:35.108
Uh, well, um,


00:23:35.141 --> 00:23:37.445
I can't connect with her
when I call.


00:23:37.478 --> 00:23:39.380
She can call me,
but I can't call out.


00:23:39.413 --> 00:23:41.482
- The line is clear when she call you?
- Yeah.


00:23:41.515 --> 00:23:44.018
It's clear enough,
but it's getting weaker.


00:23:44.051 --> 00:23:47.355
Well, that's to be expected
near somnolence


00:23:47.388 --> 00:23:49.888
No cut outs though?


00:23:49.922 --> 00:23:52.093
No, she, uh...


00:23:52.126 --> 00:23:54.562
She has no idea
what's happening to her.


00:23:54.595 --> 00:23:56.364
It's always a shame when we
lose a client that way.


00:23:59.166 --> 00:24:00.401
Right.


00:24:04.972 --> 00:24:07.208
It's getting worse.
A lot of static,


00:24:07.241 --> 00:24:08.510
is that supposed to
happen?


00:24:08.543 --> 00:24:11.146
Well, the archive experience


00:24:11.179 --> 00:24:13.481
often ends with audio calls


00:24:13.514 --> 00:24:16.417
only as the signal
begins to fade.


00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:20.920
Mind you, you know all about
these units, don't you?


00:24:20.955 --> 00:24:23.124
We're working on
some new technologies


00:24:23.157 --> 00:24:25.227
but they're not available
to the public yet.


00:24:28.663 --> 00:24:30.298
Beautiful view.


00:24:32.300 --> 00:24:34.202
Yeah, well, uh...


00:24:34.236 --> 00:24:36.638
it's one of the benefits of
being out of the way, you know


00:24:39.373 --> 00:24:41.343
And you live here on your own?


00:24:42.477 --> 00:24:44.513
Yeah, that's right.


00:24:49.117 --> 00:24:50.385
So very peaceful.


00:24:59.095 --> 00:25:00.096
Sir.


00:25:03.265 --> 00:25:06.401
The security seals
in this unit have been broken.


00:25:06.435 --> 00:25:08.203
The environmental system's
been patched.


00:25:08.236 --> 00:25:09.304
What're you talking about?


00:25:11.106 --> 00:25:12.174
Right here, on my system.


00:25:12.207 --> 00:25:14.210
Well, it's wrong.
Check it again.


00:25:14.243 --> 00:25:16.546
Home use of the archive


00:25:16.579 --> 00:25:20.082
legally constitutes storage
of the deceased user's remains.


00:25:20.116 --> 00:25:23.486
If it is opened in any way
we have a legal obligation


00:25:23.519 --> 00:25:26.155
to remove that unit
and prepare it for burial.


00:25:26.189 --> 00:25:27.556
Fuck you,
she's not going anywhere.


00:25:27.589 --> 00:25:29.724
- I gonna have to ask you to calm down.
- Don't tell me to calm down.


00:25:29.758 --> 00:25:31.627
We are deputized.


00:25:31.661 --> 00:25:32.728
and obliged to act


00:25:32.762 --> 00:25:37.133
under the Post Death
Internment Act... with force.


00:25:37.166 --> 00:25:39.602
If necessary.


00:25:41.571 --> 00:25:45.341
You know, you're standing on
corporate sovereign territory.


00:25:45.374 --> 00:25:47.211
This would be considered
an armed incursion


00:25:47.244 --> 00:25:49.179
by Archive Systems Incorporated.


00:25:49.213 --> 00:25:51.481
Are you sure you wanna start that?


00:25:53.082 --> 00:25:56.419
This simple misunderstanding
is completely my fault.


00:25:56.452 --> 00:25:59.422
I failed to give Mr. Melvin...


00:26:01.157 --> 00:26:03.494
the relevant information.


00:26:05.529 --> 00:26:06.763
Sure.


00:26:08.232 --> 00:26:09.233
Get out.


00:26:55.580 --> 00:26:56.648
Hey.


00:26:56.681 --> 00:26:58.116
How are you feeling?


00:26:59.851 --> 00:27:01.085
Confused.


00:27:01.119 --> 00:27:03.521
Yeah, I bet.


00:27:03.555 --> 00:27:06.123
Look, I'm sorry I haven't been
here to explain any of this to you.


00:27:06.156 --> 00:27:08.126
Well explain it to me now,
George.


00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:10.161
You remember me?


00:27:11.696 --> 00:27:13.131
It's pretty confusing actually.


00:27:14.465 --> 00:27:17.302
Well it, is any of it, uh,
any of it real?


00:27:17.335 --> 00:27:19.504
Any of it feel solid?


00:27:19.537 --> 00:27:23.341
Some of it feels...
Some of it feels very real. I...


00:27:24.743 --> 00:27:26.579
- Hold on.
- No. No!


00:27:26.612 --> 00:27:28.246
No.


00:27:28.279 --> 00:27:30.882
- All right, it's okay.
- Please.


00:27:30.915 --> 00:27:33.284
When I did it before it was just
for your own good, okay?


00:27:33.318 --> 00:27:37.622
I just need you
to relax into it, okay?


00:27:37.655 --> 00:27:40.726
I'm trying to minimize your trauma
before I bring you fully online.


00:27:42.194 --> 00:27:44.263
I...


00:27:44.296 --> 00:27:45.297
it's easily reversible.


00:27:46.198 --> 00:27:47.566
Don't do it again.


00:27:49.368 --> 00:27:50.569
Okay...


00:27:53.605 --> 00:27:55.473
How, uh, how did you...


00:27:55.506 --> 00:27:58.410
Ah, it's okay, it's okay.
It's all right, it's all right.


00:27:58.444 --> 00:28:00.512
Look at me, it's okay.
It's all right.


00:28:00.546 --> 00:28:01.814
It's all right.


00:28:03.415 --> 00:28:04.850
It's okay, it's okay.


00:28:08.621 --> 00:28:11.457
How does your skin feel?
It... It's a prototype.


00:28:12.925 --> 00:28:14.461
Why can't I remember things?


00:28:14.494 --> 00:28:18.297
It's, uh... It's just your consciousness,
uh, rebuilding itself, that's all.


00:28:18.330 --> 00:28:20.265
I hate being like this.


00:28:20.299 --> 00:28:22.334
These machines...
It's, it's just...


00:28:22.368 --> 00:28:25.237
It's alright. Look you need to calm down.
You need to trust me.


00:28:25.270 --> 00:28:27.573
Just relax. Calm down.


00:28:27.606 --> 00:28:29.409
It's your software.
It's finding patterns,


00:28:29.442 --> 00:28:31.244
trying to piece things together.
It...


00:28:31.277 --> 00:28:33.580
It's not a tidy process
but it is working.


00:28:33.613 --> 00:28:34.614
It's working.


00:28:35.849 --> 00:28:36.850
Okay?


00:28:39.419 --> 00:28:41.720
I don't even know
how I got here.


00:28:41.754 --> 00:28:43.389
I don't even know
what here is...


00:28:46.660 --> 00:28:48.261
I want to go home.


00:28:49.796 --> 00:28:50.797
This is home.


00:29:02.944 --> 00:29:04.645
It hurts, George.


00:29:06.013 --> 00:29:07.447
Being like this.


00:30:24.093 --> 00:30:27.395
<i>Now, for taste.</i>


00:30:27.429 --> 00:30:28.930
<i>Vanilla.</i>


00:30:28.965 --> 00:30:30.499
Do you like it?


00:30:30.532 --> 00:30:32.969
- Who doesn't like vanilla?
- Hmm.


00:30:33.002 --> 00:30:34.369
Number two.


00:30:35.938 --> 00:30:37.606
Lemon.


00:30:38.473 --> 00:30:40.643
Good. And finally?


00:30:42.012 --> 00:30:43.678
Ugh.


00:30:43.712 --> 00:30:46.015
- Lime.
- All right. Sorry about that.


00:30:48.084 --> 00:30:49.584
Okay.


00:30:49.618 --> 00:30:53.455
This might feel...
a little weird.


00:30:55.690 --> 00:30:57.627
How does that feel?


00:30:57.660 --> 00:30:59.462
- Fine.
- Yep. Any pain?


00:31:00.663 --> 00:31:02.966
- No.
- Good.


00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:04.367
Okay, give me the words again.


00:31:05.802 --> 00:31:08.570
Change. Control.


00:31:08.603 --> 00:31:11.740
- Partner. Lives.
- Good.


00:31:11.773 --> 00:31:13.076
All right.


00:31:13.110 --> 00:31:14.777
Next up.


00:31:14.811 --> 00:31:16.546
What's that?


00:31:16.579 --> 00:31:17.914
This...


00:31:19.049 --> 00:31:20.850
<i>This is Hello Puppy.</i>


00:31:20.883 --> 00:31:22.318
What do I do?


00:31:22.351 --> 00:31:25.454
You take it, you look through
it and then you play with him.


00:31:25.488 --> 00:31:27.857
You'll do stuff together.
Puzzles, things like that.


00:31:32.862 --> 00:31:35.565
What's the point
of these tests?


00:31:35.598 --> 00:31:38.601
They're pretty basic. How are they
meant to test my intelligence?


00:31:38.634 --> 00:31:40.803
They're not.
That's an empathy test.


00:31:40.837 --> 00:31:43.639
You can tell a lot about a person by
the way they interact with animals.


00:31:46.810 --> 00:31:49.880
He's asking me if I want to
watch him dance.


00:31:50.714 --> 00:31:52.850
I like it.


00:31:52.883 --> 00:31:55.452
This isn't the right component.
Where's the other one?


00:31:55.485 --> 00:31:56.519
It's not ready yet.


00:31:56.552 --> 00:31:57.854
No. I need the RK4.


00:31:57.887 --> 00:31:58.888
Come on.


00:32:04.661 --> 00:32:06.563
What was that machine?


00:32:06.597 --> 00:32:10.068
Oh, that's J2, my second prototype.
She's...


00:32:10.101 --> 00:32:11.102
She loves that thing.


00:32:13.470 --> 00:32:16.007
We'll, uh,
pick this up tomorrow, okay?


00:32:18.676 --> 00:32:20.677
So there are three of us.


00:32:28.219 --> 00:32:29.720
What happened to you face?


00:32:31.189 --> 00:32:33.390
Uh, it was an accident.


00:32:34.792 --> 00:32:36.661
How's you, uh...
How's your throat feeling?


00:32:37.829 --> 00:32:40.632
Tight. Sort of numb.


00:32:40.665 --> 00:32:41.666
Okay. You'll get used to it.


00:32:41.699 --> 00:32:45.003
You just have to keep talking
while it beds in.


00:32:45.036 --> 00:32:46.104
You sleep last night?


00:32:47.471 --> 00:32:49.207
Yes.


00:32:49.240 --> 00:32:51.076
I've been dreaming a lot.


00:32:52.510 --> 00:32:53.878
Last night I...


00:32:53.912 --> 00:32:56.514
Well I don't know if
I'm dreaming or remembering.


00:32:57.983 --> 00:32:59.550
Dreams do that, don't they?


00:33:02.754 --> 00:33:04.455
Hmm. Dreams do do that.


00:33:06.258 --> 00:33:09.094
Your AI is doing everything
it can to understand the world.


00:33:09.128 --> 00:33:11.529
To give it context.


00:33:11.562 --> 00:33:12.563
Gelling things together.


00:33:14.832 --> 00:33:15.934
Rough with the smooth, right?


00:33:20.105 --> 00:33:21.140
Right.


00:33:22.774 --> 00:33:24.144
You know I can hear you.


00:33:26.079 --> 00:33:28.982
Come on,
come in, come say hi.


00:33:29.015 --> 00:33:30.116
Meet our new house guest.


00:33:33.584 --> 00:33:35.988
Come on, come in.
Come say hello.


00:33:36.021 --> 00:33:37.488
I have to
help her out sometimes.


00:33:37.522 --> 00:33:39.191
She has problems
with her mobility.


00:33:43.796 --> 00:33:46.099
This is is J1.


00:33:49.035 --> 00:33:51.037
Hello.


00:33:51.071 --> 00:33:52.705
Sorry.


00:33:52.738 --> 00:33:54.407
No, don't say sorry.
It's my fault.


00:33:54.441 --> 00:33:58.677
Uh, work's been progressing so quickly I
didn't have time to fabricate her any arms.


00:33:58.711 --> 00:34:00.813
But I don't think you mind,
do you, girl?


00:34:01.982 --> 00:34:03.882
Are you going to
finish building me?


00:34:03.916 --> 00:34:04.917
Yeah, of course I am.


00:34:05.484 --> 00:34:08.054
- When?
- Well, um...


00:34:08.088 --> 00:34:09.155
I'm working on something.


00:34:09.189 --> 00:34:10.689
So, just give a couple of days,


00:34:10.723 --> 00:34:12.994
and hopefully you'll be
fully independent.


00:34:13.027 --> 00:34:15.695
No tethers, no battery, nothing.


00:34:18.932 --> 00:34:20.633
Days?


00:34:20.667 --> 00:34:22.701
Yeah, days. I promise.


00:34:26.572 --> 00:34:28.708
I wanna show you something.


00:34:30.244 --> 00:34:32.612
They are not like normal
robots, are they?


00:34:34.181 --> 00:34:36.217
They move differently.


00:34:36.250 --> 00:34:39.919
Yeah. Well, you're all
an attempt at the same thing.


00:34:39.954 --> 00:34:42.555
Deep tiered machine learning.


00:34:42.589 --> 00:34:45.693
Artificial intelligence.
Human equivalent to the holy grail.


00:34:45.726 --> 00:34:47.827
Now J1,


00:34:47.861 --> 00:34:51.898
she stopped developing
around here.


00:34:51.931 --> 00:34:54.601
Age five, maybe six max.


00:34:54.634 --> 00:34:56.070
And I took that,


00:34:56.103 --> 00:34:58.305
used it as a template
for version two, which is J2,


00:34:58.339 --> 00:34:59.906
who you already met.


00:34:59.939 --> 00:35:01.343
And this is her here.


00:35:01.376 --> 00:35:03.245
She stopped developing


00:35:03.278 --> 00:35:06.714
<i>around 15, maybe 16 at most.</i>


00:35:08.183 --> 00:35:11.751
And finally, this...


00:35:13.920 --> 00:35:14.989
This is you.


00:35:22.030 --> 00:35:23.764
This is me.


00:36:06.074 --> 00:36:08.844
Jesus Fucking Christ.


00:36:08.877 --> 00:36:10.113
You scared the shit out of me.


00:36:13.049 --> 00:36:14.283
- Sorry.
- Hi.


00:36:14.317 --> 00:36:16.085
I thought you were out.


00:36:16.119 --> 00:36:18.820
Yeah, well,
I was out and then I came back.


00:36:18.854 --> 00:36:21.257
And, uh, you were snoring,
by the way.


00:36:21.290 --> 00:36:24.626
I only had three hours sleep,
so. And I don't snore.


00:36:25.861 --> 00:36:27.430
Yeah, you do.


00:36:27.463 --> 00:36:29.332
Ugh.


00:36:29.365 --> 00:36:31.700
Ugh, if that's Fabian,
I'm gonna kill myself.


00:36:31.733 --> 00:36:33.702
Ah, smiling today.


00:36:33.735 --> 00:36:36.671
It's not his fault he's new and
he just doesn't know the systems.


00:36:38.307 --> 00:36:40.743
Just please don't do my section.
It's my favorite color.


00:36:40.776 --> 00:36:41.979
I won't.


00:36:46.083 --> 00:36:48.451
Hey, when you're done with
the man-baby, let's make our own baby.


00:37:18.415 --> 00:37:21.251
I'll be outside. You can get
ahold of me on this if you me.


00:37:22.953 --> 00:37:24.988
The security systems aren't
going to fix themselves.


00:37:30.361 --> 00:37:32.930
- You've got the day off.
- But I want to come with you.


00:37:32.964 --> 00:37:34.065
I don't need
your help today, okay?


00:37:34.098 --> 00:37:36.967
I just need you to stay home,
look after your sister


00:37:37.000 --> 00:37:38.901
and make sure she doesn't
get into any trouble, okay?


00:38:54.079 --> 00:38:56.115
<i>George, can you hear me?</i>


00:38:57.349 --> 00:38:59.451
Yeah, I can hear you.


00:38:59.485 --> 00:39:01.553
<i>The lights
keep cutting out in here.</i>


00:39:01.587 --> 00:39:02.787
<i>Is that you?</i>


00:39:05.124 --> 00:39:06.393
Hang on.


00:39:10.230 --> 00:39:14.500
<i>I tried that.
I do it every time something trips.</i>


00:39:14.533 --> 00:39:17.236
<i>Power supply interrupted.</i>


00:39:19.038 --> 00:39:20.172
<i>How is it now?</i>


00:39:20.205 --> 00:39:21.873
<i>Backup systems online.</i>


00:39:21.906 --> 00:39:24.544
<i>I don't know what's going on but
it's not good. Can you get back here?</i>


00:39:47.600 --> 00:39:50.203
<i>George, get back here, please.</i>


00:39:52.472 --> 00:39:53.506
Okay, I'm coming.


00:39:58.145 --> 00:40:02.116
One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven, eight...


00:40:04.517 --> 00:40:07.454
15, 16, 17. Okay, it's 17.


00:40:07.487 --> 00:40:09.022
I'm in bay three. Trip it...


00:40:14.995 --> 00:40:16.564
One, two, three, four...


00:40:16.597 --> 00:40:19.300
- I can help you count the modules.
- What?


00:40:19.333 --> 00:40:22.370
I know I did it wrong last time,
but let me try again.


00:40:22.403 --> 00:40:25.606
You just... You just made me
loose count, all right?


00:40:25.639 --> 00:40:30.044
Look, can you please
take this, recharge it, okay?


00:40:30.077 --> 00:40:31.212
All right, thank you.


00:40:47.129 --> 00:40:48.964
This place is falling apart.


00:40:53.067 --> 00:40:56.437
<i>System failure.
Emergency power.</i>


00:40:56.470 --> 00:40:57.904
How old is this site?


00:40:59.039 --> 00:41:00.675
Uh... I don't know.


00:41:02.010 --> 00:41:03.145
Older than me.


00:41:05.747 --> 00:41:07.249
<i>System online.</i>


00:41:34.377 --> 00:41:37.480
All right, bed time.
No more cartoon, all right?


00:41:39.081 --> 00:41:41.383
Yeah, I know. Okay, come on.


00:41:43.318 --> 00:41:45.287
That's all right.


00:41:45.320 --> 00:41:46.688
Good girl. Good girl.


00:41:49.058 --> 00:41:51.260
Here you go, good girl.
That's it.


00:41:51.294 --> 00:41:53.129
Now, I gotta go out
to a meeting, okay?


00:41:54.230 --> 00:41:56.232
It's fine, I'll be straight
back, right back.


00:41:57.600 --> 00:41:59.368
Hey do you know
where your sister is by the way?


00:42:26.196 --> 00:42:29.599
<i>Central resources have
dispatched a risk assessor to see you.</i>


00:42:29.632 --> 00:42:31.067
A Mr. Tagg.


00:42:31.100 --> 00:42:35.471
<i>He's got new security procedures for
you, needs a face to face.</i>


00:42:35.505 --> 00:42:36.806
<i>I don't care
what he wants.</i>


00:42:36.839 --> 00:42:40.544
<i>This is my research environment.
He's not coming here.</i>


00:42:40.577 --> 00:42:41.578
<i>Fine.</i>


00:42:41.612 --> 00:42:44.448
<i>Meet him at that
disgusting place you like.</i>


00:42:44.481 --> 00:42:47.551
<i>This is important,
9:00 tonight.</i>


00:43:12.210 --> 00:43:13.778
<i>Konnichiwa.</i>


00:43:32.864 --> 00:43:34.399
Hi, I'm George Almore.


00:43:36.401 --> 00:43:38.303
Take a seat.


00:43:45.443 --> 00:43:47.445
So, what am I doing here?


00:43:50.915 --> 00:43:52.350
I'm a risk assessor.


00:43:53.651 --> 00:43:55.486
I assess risk.


00:43:57.155 --> 00:44:01.293
And you...
You are a risk.


00:44:06.764 --> 00:44:09.601
I'm sorry, sir.
You cannot smoke in here.


00:44:09.634 --> 00:44:10.835
Really?


00:44:15.941 --> 00:44:18.611
I hope, for your sake,


00:44:18.644 --> 00:44:21.313
I don't need to use this
in the next couple of minutes.


00:44:24.350 --> 00:44:26.352
Ah, I keep forgetting.


00:44:27.519 --> 00:44:28.721
You're new to all this.


00:44:34.393 --> 00:44:36.662
Did you hear about Black Mesa?


00:44:37.830 --> 00:44:38.864
No, I didn't.


00:44:38.897 --> 00:44:40.299
Well, you should
read your circulars.


00:44:41.900 --> 00:44:43.669
Two killed, one missing.


00:44:44.870 --> 00:44:46.171
All research staff.


00:44:46.205 --> 00:44:48.608
Knew exactly what
they were doing.


00:44:48.642 --> 00:44:51.277
How to get in, who to target,


00:44:51.311 --> 00:44:52.379
what to take.


00:44:54.280 --> 00:44:56.315
So, we're escalating.


00:44:57.716 --> 00:45:00.919
And we get to be best friends.


00:45:01.787 --> 00:45:04.256
Well, I don't have time
for friends.


00:45:05.458 --> 00:45:08.228
You're being watched.


00:45:08.261 --> 00:45:10.730
- Yeah, I go that part.
- This involves her.


00:45:19.738 --> 00:45:20.739
Hmm.


00:45:35.555 --> 00:45:36.623
Two night ago.


00:45:38.359 --> 00:45:39.961
You were in my house?


00:45:39.995 --> 00:45:41.595
- It was sent to me.
- Well, who took it then?


00:45:43.530 --> 00:45:44.764
Who took the fucking picture?


00:45:46.266 --> 00:45:48.768
If I knew that


00:45:48.802 --> 00:45:51.972
I would be talking to them
instead of you.


00:45:52.006 --> 00:45:55.409
So what? This is some...
some kind of message?


00:46:00.048 --> 00:46:01.515
Your new procedures.


00:46:03.051 --> 00:46:05.319
Emergency use only.


00:46:06.487 --> 00:46:08.989
- Do you understand?
