01:40:04.891 --> 01:40:06.159
It's okay, it's okay,
it's okay.


01:40:07.193 --> 01:40:08.194
It's okay.


01:40:09.062 --> 01:40:10.629
It's okay. It's okay.


01:40:10.662 --> 01:40:12.165
It's okay. It's okay.


01:40:12.198 --> 01:40:13.832
It's okay. It's okay.


